  "notes": [
    "projectflow replan_project is listed in _PROJECTFLOW_MUTATING_ACTIONS but has no Python dispatch branch (the Go/CoPaw native route performs the replan), so it is absent from write_actions",
    "roomflow / message / artifact writes are remote (Matrix API) writes performed synchronously inside the call; filesync pull is a local write of the authoritative remote state; local state writes use the atomic replace described in 'description'",
    "read-type actions may still refresh local cache through a pull; that cache refresh is not a state mutation"
  ]
}
